From c3d9641cebbea2fa1d9c85366bc999eee11f9c5c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 28 Mar 2026 10:05:28 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/5] Add 6502 assembly web server with emulator socket API

Extend the emulator with a TCP sockets API (create, bind, listen, accept,
recv, send, close) exposed as memory-mapped I/O at $FEA0-$FEA8 with jump
table entries at $F036-$F048. Add --no-cycle-limit CLI flag for long-running
programs. Write a 6502 assembly web server serving "Hello from 6502 asm"
over HTTP/1.0 on port 8080. Include integration test and Playwright screenshot.

https://claude.ai/code/session_01WQEBoeVubK2XdXyseNFQWk
